SUMMARY:Pet Loss Support Group (Guild Room)
DESCRIPTION:Pet Loss Support Group offers a compassionate\, safe space to share your grief and find comfort with others who understand the loss of an animal companion. Bring a photo or memento to honor your special bond\, if you wish. The group meets monthly on the second Thursday and is facilitated by Animal Chaplain Vicki Lea Paulson. Please RSVP to chaplainvickilea@gmail.com or 973-619-3499.
